  "byline": null,
  "publishedAt": null,
  "contentHtml": "<p>Yes I will be doing a Conversation with him, live at the Roots of Progress event next week.&nbsp; <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Moxie_Marlinspike\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">From Wikipedia</a>:</p>\n<blockquote><p>Moxie Marlinspike is an American <a id=\"mwDQ\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Entrepreneur\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">entrepreneur</a>, <a id=\"mwDg\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cryptographer\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">cryptographer</a>, and <a id=\"mwDw\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Computer_security\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">computer security</a> researcher.<sup id=\"cite_ref-thenewyorker-2020-10-19_1-1\"></sup><sup id=\"cite_ref-2\"></sup> Marlinspike is the creator of <a id=\"mwGA\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Signal_(messaging_app)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Signal</a>, co-founder of the <a id=\"mwGQ\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Signal_Technology_Foundation\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Signal Technology Foundation</a>, and served as the first CEO of <a id=\"mwGg\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Signal_Messenger_LLC\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Signal Messenger LLC</a>. He is also a co-author of the <a id=\"mwGw\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Signal_Protocol\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Signal Protocol</a> encryption used by Signal, <a id=\"mwHA\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/WhatsApp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">WhatsApp</a>,<sup id=\"cite_ref-Greenberg-31-07-2016_3-0\"></sup> <a id=\"mwIQ\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Google_Messages\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Google Messages</a>,<sup id=\"cite_ref-4\"></sup> <a id=\"mwJg\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Facebook_Messenger\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Facebook Messenger</a><sup id=\"cite_ref-5\"></sup> and <a id=\"mwKw\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Skype\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Skype</a>.</p></blockquote>\n<p>There is much more at the link, for instance he is also an anarchist of some kind or another.&nbsp; So what should I ask him?</p>",
